:false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80064,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9da6bf989d72cee0b45a882511094d56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@racht33&amp;nbsp; Hi. I&#039;m not sure that you&#039;ll be able to get an exact match on your colour, but there are definitely several different sites you can look at that will give you some options, especially being in the US. The brides here that are in canada have a much more difficult time with bulk sites, and ordering from the US with shipping to canada can get very expensive! Having said that, here&#039;s a couple of sites that I found that I know other brides here have used.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.discountmugs.com\/category\/sunglasses-and-accessories\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.discountmugs.com\/category\/sunglasses-and-accessories\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.logolenses.com\/shop\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.logolenses.com\/shop\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913227,"PostDate":1462114959,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@racht33\u00a0 Hi. I'm not sure that you'll be able to get an exact match on your colour, but there are definitely several different sites you can look at that will give you some options, especially being in the US. The brides here that are in canada have a much more difficult time with bulk sites, and ordering from the US with shipping to canada can get very expensive! Having said that, here's a couple of sites that I found that I know other brides here have used.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.discountmugs.com\/category\/sunglasses-and-accessories\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.discount...nd-accessories\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.logolenses.com\/shop\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.logolenses.com\/shop\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"80064","Title":"Sunglasses","LastPostDate":1462114959},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
