e song we&#039;ve been saying forever we would use - Brad Paisley - then.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;They won&#039;t be at our wedding, but there will be a fair amount of overlap on the guests.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Would it be weird to still use it, or should we find a new song?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807716,"PostDate":1381998611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So, I went to a wedding this weekend, she's a fairly close friend, and her first some came on and it was the same song we've been saying forever we would use - Brad Paisley - then.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>They won't be at our wedding, but there will be a fair amount of overlap on the guests.<\/p> <p>Would it be weird to still use it, or should we find a new song?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.harmer6@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.129.72.221","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1374168567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271696.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sharmer","Id":271696,"Name":"sharmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75370,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40925177c7e4de2cfd2c32ca5356a6bb","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;sharmer&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;So, I went to a wedding this weekend, she&#039;s a fairly close friend, and her first some came on and it was the same song we&#039;ve been saying forever we would use - Brad Paisley - then.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;They won&#039;t be at our wedding, but there will be a fair amount of overlap on the guests.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Would it be weird to still use it, or should we find a new song?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;\n I would just talk to her about it. If she&#039;s a good friend, she won&#039;t care. And I doubt the guests will be like \"OMG she totally stole her song\" - Lol. Go for what makes you happy and love! It&#039;s yours and your fiances day, you can&#039;t please everyone so go with what you love!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807749,"PostDate":1382008217,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>sharmer<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>So, I went to a wedding this weekend, she's a fairly close friend, and her first some came on and it was the same song we've been saying forever we would use - Brad Paisley - then.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>They won't be at our wedding, but there will be a fair amount of overlap on the guests.<\/p> <p>Would it be weird to still use it, or should we find a new song?<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p><br \/> I would just talk to her about it. If she's a good friend, she won't care. And I doubt the guests will be like \"OMG she totally stole her song\" - Lol. Go for what makes you happy and love! It's yours and your fiances day, you can't please everyone so go with what you love!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chelsea_catanzarita@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"8.28.150.75","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1352898172,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262370.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":183,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChelseaCat802","Id":262370,"Name":"ChelseaCat802","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.239.247.54","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75370,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b415affbf41ade6f754e13c5be20b3b6","RawContent":"Yeah I agree it&#039;s your wedding! Use your song, don&#039;t worry about others!","Attachments":[],"Id":1824594,"PostDate":1389302821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yeah I agree it's your wedding! Use your song, don't worry about others!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kacielking@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.239.247.54","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1379608342,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273614.png?_r=1408114193","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kbride2014","Id":273614,"Name":"kbride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.28.245.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75370,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08c8dfccb268bff91e2c36509ad5aef0","RawContent":"It&#039;s your wedding, use what you want!","Attachments":[],"Id":1827258,"PostDate":1390092087,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It's your wedding, use what you want!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kdnolan@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.69.243","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1366576642,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268830.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kdnolan","Id":268830,"Name":"kdnolan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.119.64.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75370,"EditedBy":