bject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.248.183.177","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd0da2cb59e4055566c73a4f317eab04","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sent Tammy! I also called but got your voicemail&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913225,"PostDate":1462129856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sent Tammy! I also called but got your voicemail<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"06dixon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.248.183.177","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462125402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"2017weddingguy","Id":286853,"Name":"2017weddingguy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.13.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83d3f3212aa6d51a65d8e85f0cbdd673","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@2017weddingguy&amp;nbsp; I found it. It&#039;s the Sky Terrace ceremony location at Azul Fives resort in Mexico, which is a Karisma property. It&#039;s a very popular resort on this site with brides, just because of the sky terrace location. It does cost. The last I heard they charge $1800 to have that location but i think there might be some inclusives with it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\n (It&#039;s the same photo)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913233,"PostDate":1462141171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@2017weddingguy\u00a0 I found it. It's the Sky Terrace ceremony location at Azul Fives resort in Mexico, which is a Karisma property. It's a very popular resort on this site with brides, just because of the sky terrace location. It does cost. The last I heard they charge $1800 to have that location but i think there might be some inclusives with it.<\/p>\n<p>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913233]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-232000-0-29107600-1462137490.jpg\" title=\"sky-02.jpg - Size: 31.3KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-232000-0-29107600-1462137490.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"sky-02.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n (It's the same photo)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80068,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 02 May 2016 - 11:08 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1462216116,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a37bc4af9e80c86ebd15d254bf05167f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi 2017weddingguy - welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding!!!&amp;nbsp; You&#039;re sure to find lots of helpful info here to answer your planning questions - so well done on a great start already!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some more magical wedding moments that matter taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Sparks-fly-at-Azul-Fives-Wedding-in-Playa-del-Carmen\/k7mfu\/56a0ef840cf2f3c826e0fcbc&#039;&gt;Azul Fives Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt; to show you what a beautiful wedding venue it is......enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_e92a717f439f4808a4872454af1827b8.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1243,h_829,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_e92a717f439f4808a4872454af1827b8.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_e92a717f439f4808a4872454af1827b8.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_5a913e3c2fd943629be607df689d098a.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1243,h_829,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_5a913e3c2fd943629be607df689d098a.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_5a913e3c2fd943629be607df689d098a.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_375a0dd8ecff4fb5879952ccc8fb868a.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1243,h_829,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_375a0dd8ecff4fb5879952ccc8fb868a.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_375a0dd8ecff4fb5879952ccc8fb868a.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the Best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913256,"PostDate":1462216028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi 2017weddingguy - welcome to our forum community and Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding!!!\u00a0 You're sure to find lots of helpful info here to answer your planning questions - so well done on a great start already!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are some more magical wedding moments that matter taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Sparks-fly-at-Azul-Fives-Wedding-in-Playa-del-Carmen\/k7mfu\/56a0ef840cf2f3c826e0fcbc' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Fives Wedding Album<\/a> to show you what a beautiful wedding venue it is......enjoy!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_e92a717f439f4808a4872454af1827b8.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1243,h_829,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_e92a717f439f4808a4872454af1827b8.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_e92a717f439f4808a4872454af1827b8.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_5a913e3c2fd943629be607df689d098a.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1243,h_829,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_5a913e3c2fd943629be607df689d098a.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_5a913e3c2fd943629be607df689d098a.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_375a0dd8ecff4fb5879952ccc8fb868a.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1243,h_829,al_c,q_90,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01\/e89d55_375a0dd8ecff4fb5879952ccc8fb868a.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_375a0dd8ecff4fb5879952ccc8fb868a.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the Best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.193.1.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d04dcbdc66324fbdf9f309f919da90f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks! We&#039;re looking to have our wedding not in Mexico! The search continues but thanks again.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913258,"PostDate":1462227256,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks! We're looking to have our wedding not in Mexico! The search continues but thanks again.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"06dixon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.248.183.177","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462125402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"2017weddingguy","Id":286853,"Name":"2017weddingguy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.106.64.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aff67f92e59bb10e6d6586c250572fdc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"2017weddingguy\"] &amp;nbsp;There&#039;s also an Azul Sensatori in Jamaica that I think has a sky deck too.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913281,"PostDate":1462299821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286853\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286853-2017weddingguy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">2017weddingguy<\/span><\/a> \u00a0There's also an Azul Sensatori in Jamaica that I think has a sky deck too.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.40.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80068,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6977eecc11580703b657663d718976b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hi @2017weddingguy&amp;nbsp; This is at Azul Fives in the Riviera Maya, Mexico, just north of Playa del Carmen. This is their beautiful Sky Terrace location at their resort which is a Karisma property. We very recently saw a wedding up there and it was beautiful however it may be pricey but I think their may be all inclusive options per day\/week, etc. Perhaps check out their website for more info.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.karismahotels.com\/Hotels-Resorts-Villas\/For-Everyone\/Azul-Hotels\/Azul-Fives-Hotel&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.karismahotels.com\/Hotels-Resorts-Villas\/For-Everyone\/Azul-Hotels\/Azul-Fives-Hotel&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; Good luck with your planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913355,"PostDate":1462487870,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hi @2017weddingguy\u00a0 This is at Azul Fives in the Riviera Maya, Mexico, just north of Playa del Carmen. This is their beautiful Sky Terrace location at their resort which is a Karisma property. We very recently saw a wedding up there and it was beautiful however it may be pricey but I think their may be all inclusive options per day\/week, etc. Perhaps check out their website for more info.\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.karismahotels.com\/Hotels-Resorts-Villas\/For-Everyone\/Azul-Hotels\/Azul-Fives-Hotel' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.karismaho...zul-Fives-Hotel<\/a>\u00a0 Good luck with your planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"social@stylingtrio.com","IpAddress":"189.221.40.208","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1462483132,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286883.jpg?_r=1462564250","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","Id":286883,"Name":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80068","Title":"Trying To Find Out What Venue This Is","LastPostDate":1462487870},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
