""},"FormattedName":"bridecdb","Id":285337,"Name":"bridecdb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.105.98.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9f085b2ba0b59b8d36084832ebd7edb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@bridecdb&amp;nbsp; Thanks so much for all of the info!&amp;nbsp; This was soooo helpful!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909837,"PostDate":1453397274,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@bridecdb\u00a0 Thanks so much for all of the info!\u00a0 This was soooo helpful!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jasminearceo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.105.98.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398977405,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277804.jpg?_r=1416936614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jazzzy23","Id":277804,"Name":"jazzzy23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.62.73.244","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f22d9c0b6a94d2368a9e8def71b9ece5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;how funny, some of those pictures on that facebook are of my wedding. I got married here late last year and I loved it! the hotel coordinator was so nice and helpful, the food we picked was amazinggggg and the accommodations were great! I would definitely recommend this hotel, all of our guests loved it! some are even going back soon in a few months.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909842,"PostDate":1453400660,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>how funny, some of those pictures on that facebook are of my wedding. I got married here late last year and I loved it! the hotel coordinator was so nice and helpful, the food we picked was amazinggggg and the accommodations were great! I would definitely recommend this hotel, all of our guests loved it! some are even going back soon in a few months.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ramiresy@elac.edu","IpAddress":"198.188.146.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414168977,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"syr87","Id":280844,"Name":"syr87","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.33.154.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5fff40b16df86df9c99169dcf90be7b9","RawContent":"Thanks for the comment @[member=\"syr87\"]. It&#039;s good to hear you had a positive experience. Any tips for future Fiesta brides? What menu item(s) did you love the most? I&#039;m hosting my wedding Aug 2015.","Attachments":[],"Id":1909845,"PostDate":1453401020,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the comment @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280844\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280844-syr87\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">syr87<\/span><\/a>. It's good to hear you had a positive experience. Any tips for future Fiesta brides? What menu item(s) did you love the most? I'm hosting my wedding Aug 2015. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#b22222;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">CDB<\/span><\/span>","Email":"washwedding2016@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.194.122.2","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447572000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"bridecdb","Id":285337,"Name":"bridecdb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.172.236.211","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e373e5da634bb65448f027517c7a3b12","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is a wedding I had a couple of monts ago at Fiesta Americana, every turn out great. I hope you like the pictures:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/fiesta-americana-los-cabos-wedding-jenni-and-mike&#039;&gt;www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/fiesta-americana-los-cabos-wedding-jenni-and-mike&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gonzalo Verdeja&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910780,"PostDate":1455235368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is a wedding I had a couple of monts ago at Fiesta Americana, every turn out great. I hope you like the pictures:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/fiesta-americana-los-cabos-wedding-jenni-and-mike' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.gvphotographer.com\/blog\/fiesta-americana-los-cabos-wedding-jenni-and-mike<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!<\/p>\n<p>Gonzalo Verdeja<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@artncolors.com","IpAddress":"189.176.187.29","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1258590501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223381.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GVphotographer","Id":223381,"Name":"GVphotographer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.216.157.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39f29263a467970325a46716e6b093d4","RawContent":"What is the outside vendor fee? I&#039;m planning to use a videographer based out of Puerto Vallarta. Also, has anyone used TravelZap for group TA with Fiesta Grand Americana Los Cabos ?","Attachments":[],"Id":1912378,"PostDate":1459454078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                What is the outside vendor fee? I'm planning to use a videographer based out of Puerto Vallarta. Also, has anyone used TravelZap for group TA with Fiesta Grand Americana Los Cabos ?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amtaag@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.216.157.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459453056,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286617.jpg?_r=1460651572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AnaMarie","Id":286617,"Name":"AnaMarie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.232.102.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79818,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f527fcc9b81974cf25615b84ba5c95c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am new to this and also looking at this resort. Any tips or information would be greatly appreciated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912555,"PostDate":1459872861,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am new to this and also looking at this resort. Any tips or information would be greatly appreciated.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lill.tiffany123@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.232.102.14","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459871202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tlill123","Id":286652,"Name":"tlill123","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79818","Title":"Fiesta Grand Americana Cabo Brides 2016","LastPostDate":1462406022},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
