","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447903542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"acfuller","Id":285377,"Name":"acfuller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.83.103.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79770ba5a708f5231e46c1bf2fd9616c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Did anyone book the lights and lanterns decoration for above the reception? I really want to do it but i got 2 different quotes, 1 being $900 and one $580 FOR CHRISTMAS LIGHTS!!! Kind of nuts........ although i can bring my own and have them set it up. I have limited luggage space as it is! And not sure how many strands i would need etc.&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/d5\/0e\/3d\/d50e3dfac5dd90d6c1852e8c310d956d.jpg\" alt=\"d50e3dfac5dd90d6c1852e8c310d956d.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908165,"PostDate":1449502045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Did anyone book the lights and lanterns decoration for above the reception? I really want to do it but i got 2 different quotes, 1 being $900 and one $580 FOR CHRISTMAS LIGHTS!!! Kind of nuts........ although i can bring my own and have them set it up. I have limited luggage space as it is! And not sure how many strands i would need etc.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/d5\/0e\/3d\/d50e3dfac5dd90d6c1852e8c310d956d.jpg\" alt=\"d50e3dfac5dd90d6c1852e8c310d956d.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smchambers06@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.182.103.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419351208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281467.jpeg?_r=1457907391","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samFEB2016","Id":281467,"Name":"samFEB2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62355e94d8cbf9c4e548f44fcbe63e41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;yikes! I wonder what the normal lighting looks like ?! Is the $900 for the lanterns and xmas&amp;nbsp;lights and the 580 for just xmas lights?!&amp;nbsp;These costs seem kinda crazy and almost comical now&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908193,"PostDate":1449542940,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>yikes! I wonder what the normal lighting looks like ?! Is the $900 for the lanterns and xmas\u00a0lights and the 580 for just xmas lights?!\u00a0These costs seem kinda crazy and almo