{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63e7034655c3bfb51c990278395f7f2c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I haven&#039;t received any info and my wedding date is May 20th and we leave May 16, 2016! We have all of the guests booked (58 adults) and I know&amp;nbsp;we have the gazebo and Baja Notre booked.&amp;nbsp; We had that confirmed as for prices I have no idea?! Could one of you send me the list ?! &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;mailto:amberpetersen35@hotmail.com&#039;&gt;amberpetersen35@hotmail.com&lt;\/a&gt; that&amp;nbsp;would be very kind! &amp;nbsp;As for hair and make-up I booked with Susan out side the hotel &amp;nbsp;and I&#039;m using Gilda Badillo for photos!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907243,"PostDate":1446951103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I haven't received any info and my wedding date is May 20th and we leave May 16, 2016! We have all of the guests booked (58 adults) and I know\u00a0we have the gazebo and Baja Notre booked.\u00a0 We had that confirmed as for prices I have no idea?! Could one of you send me the list ?! <a href='mailto:amberpetersen35@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>amberpetersen35@hotmail.com<\/a> that\u00a0would be very kind! \u00a0As for hair and make-up I booked with Susan out side the hotel \u00a0and I'm using Gilda Badillo for photos!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberpetersen35@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437973870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284153.jpeg?_r=1454355937","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ambie","Id":284153,"Name":"Ambie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.238.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b30fdb4143f7ec230ced066692dd87cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Ambie\"] I sent it. How did you confirm your reception area so early? I really want to reserve mine as early as possible and I haven&#039;t been able to reach anyone.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907244,"PostDate":1446952079,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284153\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284153-ambie\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Ambie<\/span><\/a> I sent it. How did you confirm your reception area so early? I really want to reserve mine as early as possible and I haven't been able to reach anyone.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ana.avant87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.35.67.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437741737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284112.jpg?_r=1437784941","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CaboBride6252016","Id":284112,"Name":"CaboBride6252016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7baead0cf8953458ad541fcf3644af23","RawContent":"I asked my travel agent to ask her.. I told them we would pay in advance for the location but they just responded and said we have it booked and they won&#039;t do anything else till 3 months before the wedding !!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1907246,"PostDate":1446952814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I asked my travel agent to ask her.. I told them we would pay in advance for the location but they just responded and said we have it booked and they won't do anything else till 3 months before the wedding !!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberpetersen35@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437973870,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284153.jpeg?_r=1454355937","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ambie","Id":284153,"Name":"Ambie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.83.103.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87600d958e608e8086ed3fe6031d0f8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"CaboBride6252016\"] I did the same thing, had someone with the travel agency contact them. I basically told the WC I booked this wedding over a year in advance and will cancel if I don&#039;t get the location i want for the reception!!! Sometimes you have to be aggressive... oops! :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907327,"PostDate":1447178962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284112\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/284112-cabobride6252016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CaboBride6252016<\/span><\/a> I did the same thing, had someone with the travel agency contact them. I basically told the WC I booked this wedding over a year in advance and will cancel if I don't get the location i want for the reception!!! Sometimes you have to be aggressive... oops! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smchambers06@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.182.103.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419351208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281467.jpeg?_r=1457907391","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samFEB2016","Id":281467,"Name":"samFEB2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.180.146.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d37efcaddf876018b3b87ba859a8553","RawContent":"In diy mode working on my boutineers ....havent glued them together yet... but heres my idea for them..what are u guys diy?","Attachments":[{"Id":34315,"Name":"20151114_160127.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-284112-0-64691900-1447542353.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-284112-0-64691900-1447542353_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":563},{"Id":34316,"Name":"20151114_161456.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-284112-0-93136600-1447542392.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_11_2015\/post-284112-0-93136600-1447542392_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":563}],"Id":1907569,"PostDate":1447546118,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                In diy mode working on my boutineers ....havent glued them together yet... but heres my idea for them..what are u guys diy?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ana.avant87@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.35.67.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437741737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284112.jpg?_r=1437784941","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CaboBride6252016","Id":284112,"Name":"CaboBride6252016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.117.106.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a31e34808342d03d9e2e6626a9ac8346","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am a 2015 Riu Palace Cabo Bride! They will take such good care of you! Enjoy your special day!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1907687,"PostDate":1447904384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am a 2015 Riu Palace Cabo Bride! They will take such good care of you! Enjoy your special day!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anniecfuller@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.117.106.66","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1447903542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"acfuller","Id":285377,"Name":"acfuller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.83.103.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79770ba5a708f5231e46c1bf2fd9616c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Did anyone book the lights and lanterns decoration for above the reception? I really want to do it but i got 2 different quotes, 1 being $900 and one $580 FOR CHRISTMAS LIGHTS!!! Kind of nuts........ although i can bring my own and have them set it up. I have limited luggage space as it is! And not sure how many strands i would need etc.&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/d5\/0e\/3d\/d50e3dfac5dd90d6c1852e8c310d956d.jpg\" alt=\"d50e3dfac5dd90d6c1852e8c310d956d.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908165,"PostDate":1449502045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Did anyone book the lights and lanterns decoration for above the reception? I really want to do it but i got 2 different quotes, 1 being $900 and one $580 FOR CHRISTMAS LIGHTS!!! Kind of nuts........ although i can bring my own and have them set it up. I have limited luggage space as it is! And not sure how many strands i would need etc.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com\/236x\/d5\/0e\/3d\/d50e3dfac5dd90d6c1852e8c310d956d.jpg\" alt=\"d50e3dfac5dd90d6c1852e8c310d956d.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smchambers06@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.182.103.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419351208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281467.jpeg?_r=1457907391","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samFEB2016","Id":281467,"Name":"samFEB2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.71.137.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62355e94d8cbf9c4e548f44fcbe63e41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;yikes! I wonder what the normal lighting looks like ?! Is the $900 for the lanterns and xmas&amp;nbsp;lights and the 580 for just xmas lights?!&amp;nbsp;These costs seem kinda crazy and almost comical now&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908193,"PostDate":1449542940,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>yikes! I wonder what the normal lighting looks like ?! Is the $900 for the lanterns and xmas\u00a0lights and the 580 for just xmas lights?!\u00a0These costs seem kinda crazy and almo