Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.83.103.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b83b1c2a6cf659b00a79e95d3cb1a853","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;@&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286583-apbride2be\/\" title=\"\"&gt;apbride2be&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Congrats!! Our wedding was amazing I am so happy with how everything turned out. I would definitely say its cheaper than here (Chicago) compared to all of my friends weddings. However the wedding meals are not always included. Depends how you want to do things, I&#039;m sure you can tell from the pricing AmorDeMiVida sent! If you do a private event (like beach reception or Baja Norte) you pay per plate, however you can negotiate your way to open bar the whole time. I think if you do a semi private event at a restaurant, the meals may be included but I&#039;m not 100% sure. We had 55 guests and everyone had the best time, they want us to go back annually for our anniversary hahaha&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;If you have any other questions, I would be happy to answer them!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912881,"PostDate":1460737766,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">@<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286583-apbride2be\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>apbride2be<\/a>\u00a0Congrats!! Our wedding was amazing I am so happy with how everything turned out. I would definitely say its cheaper than here (Chicago) compared to all of my friends weddings. However the wedding meals are not always included. Depends how you want to do things, I'm sure you can tell from the pricing AmorDeMiVida sent! If you do a private event (like beach reception or Baja Norte) you pay per plate, however you can negotiate your way to open bar the whole time. I think if you do a semi private event at a restaurant, the meals may be included but I'm not 100% sure. We had 55 guests and everyone had the best time, they want us to go back annually for our anniversary hahaha<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(68,112,140);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">If you have any other questions, I would be happy to answer them!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smchambers06@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.182.103.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419351208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281467.jpeg?_r=1457907391","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samFEB2016","Id":281467,"Name":"samFEB2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.49.200.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79438,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1461984458,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d42976e4efa74cc83505201bf75ee96b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"samFEB2016\"] I am getting married at the Riu Palace January 2017 and also have about 55 guests. &amp;nbsp;Did you do a private dinner at baja norte? &amp;nbsp;or did you go for the beach reception? &amp;nbsp;what did you do for music? &amp;nbsp;did you have any advice? &amp;nbsp;Thank you so much for your thoughts!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913197,"PostDate":1461984437,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281467\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281467-samfeb2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">samFEB2016<\/span><\/a> I am getting married at the Riu Palace January 2017 and also have about 55 guests. \u00a0Did you do a private dinner at baja norte? \u00a0or did you go for the beach reception? \u00a0what did you do for music? \u00a0did you have any advice? \u00a0Thank you so much for your thoughts!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christalepik@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.49.200.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452158752,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MrsMakasa","Id":285807,"Name":"MrsMakasa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.79.229","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDe